===Interjection===
'''[[fuck]] [[me]]!'''

# {{context|vulgar}} used [[imperative]]ly when one wants a partner to [[have sex]] with oneself, often in a [[rough]] manner
# {{context|vulgar|slang|mainly US}} An expression of [[dismay]] at undesired events happening to oneself.
#: ''Oh, '''fuck me!'''  I forgot to pay that parking ticket; now they want me to appear in court!''

